      "id": 490083,
      "username": "golu07",
      "name": "Golu Kumar",
      "created_at": "2026-01-03T00:08:17.837Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello guys,<br>\nI was also facing the same issue initially.<br>\nI resolved it by running the following command in the system console:</p>\n<p><code>frappe.db.set_value(\"DocType\", \"Quotation\", \"owner\", \"Administrator\")</code></p>\n<p>If you are facing the same issue, please try this on your end and let me know if it works.</p>",
